    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror game where you explore a twisted realm of nightmares, confront grotesque monsters and piece together the mystery of the Hemobloom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different areas with their own monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the story through notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked doors and keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Door to many nightmares.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
